prompt Read REMEMBER + the 1024-round itinerary + the six-season double-seat; take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first; approve own design rounds; send each finished increment as its own signed round; stop at custody gates.
think Read the itinerary and double-seat docs and the REMEMBER card. Season A (Hardware & Right-to-Repair) is open; the Open Image journey is the live front, HUNK25 (3x3 convolve/blur/sharpen) the latest landed rung.
think Chose the next crux Lindy-first crux-first. The filter family had only fixed-rule maps; the first verb that MEASURES before it maps is auto-levels. That is the analytical crux the levels/curves tools stand on — more durable than one more kernel, more tractable in provable integer math than a color-preserving histogram equalization.
think Landed image/photos.rye stretch — a pure two-pass per-channel contrast stretch. First scan finds each color channel lo/hi; second pass maps [lo,hi] onto [0,255] in u32 (255*255=65025 far inside u32), rounding half added before truncation. A flat channel passes through (no divide by zero); a full-range channel is a fixed point; the map is monotone; alpha untouched.
think Proved by the algebra it must obey, not one arithmetic: a dim red ramp [40,60,80,100] with flat green/blue stretches to the exact rounded [0,85,170,255]; the flat channels pass through; order preserved; a full-range channel and a solid color byte-identical; alpha rides through; source pure; still-open round-trip; EmptyImage refusal.
obs Isolated the stretch to the red channel in the ramp test (green/blue held flat) so the exact arithmetic is unambiguous — the flat channels double as the passthrough proof.
obs Witness bracket-regex greps failed under BRE character-class parsing; switched the two literal-string greps to grep -F. GREEN after.
obs Self-approved design round (agent-doable, no gate). No breach, no cairn. No network/key/funds — hardware buys stay custody gates #2/#3, untouched.
